  "releaseNotes": "- Added TabInstance.LoadingMessage to show an optional tab loading message\n    - Adding Confirmation Dialogs to buttons when doing potentially dangerous operations like deleting files\n    - Added Avalonia theme tweaks for ScrollBar, Flyouts, and ComboBox\n    - Added data binding to Themes Tab to enable and disable the save button based on the name being specified\n    - Added PublicData support for local file serializer so the File Viewer can restrict permissions when loading serialized files\n    - The Tab Formatted ComboBox now updates the BindingList when the list changes\n    - Fixed ListProperty attempting to show properties that require parameters\n    - Fixed nullable booleans showing as Text instead of CheckBox Columns in the DataGrid\n    - Removed unused SummaryAttribute",
